  "label": "White Supremacist Ideology",
  "description": "The meme is rooted in white supremacist ideology, which seeks to maintain white dominance by devaluing or demonizing non-white groups. The text 'we should respect blacks' is used ironically to suggest that Black people are not worthy of respect or are being replaced by white people, which is a core tenet of white supremacist thought. This ideology is often expressed through hate speech and racially charged imagery.",
